Description: VATAN desktop session for Pardus
 VATAN is a desktop session for Pardus 25 GNOME. It replaces the top bar
 with an island at the bottom of the screen that holds the dock, Komut
 (a command bar that understands Turkish actions, apps, files and
 calculations), the workspace button and the system status.
 .
 It installs next to GNOME: choose "VATAN" from the gear menu on the login
 screen, choose "GNOME" to go back. The stock GNOME session is not changed.
